          className="e-section e-bg-color-off-white e-pad-6"
        >
          <h1
            id="title"
          >
            MEX format documentation
          </h1>
          <p>
            <strong>
              27.1.2022
            </strong>
          </p>
          <div
            className="exam-instruction notification e-pad-4"
            data-annotation-anchor="exam-instruction"
          >
            
    
            <p>
              
      This exam describes the MEX XML format.
    
            </p>
            
    
            <p>
              
      For more information about using this format, see
      
              <a
                href="https://github.com/digabi/exam-engine"
              >
                https://github.com/digabi/exam-engine
              </a>
              
    
            </p>
            
    
            <div
              className="warning-box"
            >
              
      Some of the features have limited support in
      
              <a
                href="https://oma.abitti.fi/"
              >
                Abitti
              </a>
              
      . These are documented in warning boxes like this.
    
            </div>
            
  
          </div>
          <div
            className="main-toc-container"
