            <h3
              className="exam-question-title"
              id="question-title-11"
            >
              <strong
                className="exam-question-title__display-number"
              >
                11. 
              </strong>
              
        dnd-answer
      
               
              <span
                className="e-score e-nowrap e-score--large e-font-size-l e-semibold"
              >
                8 p.
              </span>
            </h3>
            
      
            <div
              className="exam-question-instruction e-mrg-b-2"
              id="question-instruction-179"
            >
              
        
              <p>
                
          
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer
                </code>
                
          is a 
                <code>
                  connect
                </code>
                 type of drag-and-drop element. 
          The correct answer is defined by placing a question in the 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-title
                </code>
                 element and the correct answer option in the 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-option
                </code>
                 within the 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer
                </code>
                 element. 
          
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer
                </code>
                 elements are placed within the 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-container
                </code>
                 element.
          Wrong answers are defined by placing 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-option
                </code>
                 elements within the 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-container
                </code>
                 element. 
          
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-title
                </code>
                 and 
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer-option
                </code>
                 can contain text, images, formulas and audio.
          
                <br />
                <br />
                <code>
                  e:dnd-answer
                </code>
                 is automatically graded based on a set of correct answers
        
              </p>
              
      
            </div>
            

      
            <table
              className="e-table e-width-full"
            >
