                    An alternative assistive title that describes the equation
            for screen readers, perhaps using AsciiMath or Unicode
            notation
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    meta
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    String
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    No
                  </td>
