          <span
            className="e-screen-reader-only"
          >
            \\LaTeX
          </span>
          
          source code of the
          formula is displayed for screen readers. If you want to provide an
          alternative screen reader representation of the formula, use the
          
          <code>
            assistive-title
          </code>
          
          attribute.
        
