        <div
          className="e-exam-question e-level-0 e-mrg-b-8 e-clearfix"
          id="9"
        >
          
      
          <h3
            className="exam-question-title"
          >
            <strong
              className="exam-question-title__display-number"
            >
              9. 
            </strong>
            
        dropdown-answer
      
             
          </h3>
          
      
          <div
            className="exam-question-instruction e-mrg-b-2"
            id="question-instruction-177"
          >
            
        
            <p>
              
          
              <code>
                e:dropdown-answer
              </code>
              
          creates a dropdown menu.
        Similarly to
          
              <code>
                e:choice-answer
              </code>
              
          , answer options are defined within it using
          
              <code>
                e:dropdown-anser-option
              </code>
              
          elements.
        
            </p>
            
      
          </div>
          

      
          <table
            className="e-table e-width-full"
          >
            <caption>
              
          Element attributes (
          
              <code>
                e:dropdown-answer
              </code>
              
          )
        
            </caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>
                  Attribute
                </th>
                <th>
                  Type
                </th>
                <th>
                  Mandatory
                </th>
                <th>
                  Default value
                </th>
                <th>
                  Description
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  ordering
                </td>
                <td>
                  
              
                  <code>
                    random | fixed
                  </code>
                  
            
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  random
                </td>
                <td>
                  Ordering of options
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  class
                </td>
                <td>
                  CSS class
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  -
                </td>
                <td>
                  CSS class name
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  meta
                </td>
                <td>
                  String
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  –
                </td>
                <td>
                  Metadata about element
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          

      
          <table
            className="e-table e-width-full"
          >
            <caption>
              
          Element attributes (
          
              <code>
                e:dropdown-answer-option
              </code>
              
          )
        
            </caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>
                  Attribute
                </th>
                <th>
                  Type
                </th>
                <th>
                  Mandatory
                </th>
                <th>
                  Default value
                </th>
                <th>
                  Description
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  score
                </td>
                <td>
                  Integer
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  0
                </td>
                <td>
                  Score for option
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  class
                </td>
                <td>
                  CSS class
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  -
                </td>
                <td>
                  CSS class name
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  meta
                </td>
                <td>
                  String
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  –
                </td>
                <td>
                  Metadata about element
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          

      
          <h4>
            Example
          </h4>
          
      
          <pre
            className="code"
          >
            &lt;e:dropdown-answer&gt;
  &lt;e:dropdown-answer-option score="2"&gt;Lorem&lt;/e:dropdown-answer-option&gt;
  &lt;e:dropdown-answer-option score="-1"&gt;Ipsum&lt;/e:dropdown-answer-option&gt;
  &lt;e:dropdown-answer-option score="-1"&gt;Dolor&lt;/e:dropdown-answer-option&gt;
  &lt;e:dropdown-answer-option&gt;Sit&lt;/e:dropdown-answer-option&gt;
&lt;/e:dropdown-answer&gt;
          </pre>
          
      
          <div
            className="example"
          >
            
        
            <span
              className="e-dropdown-answer__answered e-dropdown-answer__answered--wrong"
              data-question-id={8}
            >
              <span
                className="e-screen-reader-only"
              >
                [Vastaus alkaa]
              </span>
              Ipsum
              <span
                className="e-screen-reader-only"
              >
                [Vastaus päättyy]
              </span>
            </span>
            <span
              aria-hidden={true}
              className="e-dropdown-answer__correct"
            >
              Lorem
            </span>
            <span
              className="e-result-scorecount e-float-right"
              id="9.9"
            >
              <span
                className="e-result-scorecount-border-wrap"
              >
                <b>
                  -1
                </b>
                 
                / 2 
                 
                 p.
              </span>
            </span>
            
      
          </div>
          
    
        </div>
        

    
        <div
          className="e-exam-question e-level-0 e-mrg-b-8 e-clearfix"
          id="10"
        >
          
      
          <h3
            className="exam-question-title"
          >
            <strong
              className="exam-question-title__display-number"
            >
              10. 
            </strong>
            
        scored-text-answer
      
             
          </h3>
          
      
          <div
            className="exam-question-instruction e-mrg-b-2"
            id="question-instruction-178"
          >
            
        
            <p>
              
          
              <code>
                e:scored-text-answer
              </code>
              
          is like
          
              <code>
                e:text-answer
              </code>
              
          , but it
          is graded automatically based on a set of correct answers. To display answer hints
          on the right side of the page, group
          
              <code>
                e:scored-text-answer
              </code>
              
          elements
          within a
          
              <code>
                e:hints
              </code>
              
          element.
        
            </p>
            
        
            <div
              className="warning-box"
            >
              
          scored-text-answer grading must be done manually in Abitti.
        
            </div>
            
      
          </div>
          

      
          <table
            className="e-table e-width-full"
          >
            <caption>
              
          Element attributes (
          
              <code>
                e:scored-text-answer
              </code>
              
          )
        
            </caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>
                  Attribute
                </th>
                <th>
                  Type
                </th>
                <th>
                  Mandatory
                </th>
                <th>
                  Default value
                </th>
                <th>
                  Description
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  max-score
                </td>
                <td>
                  Integer
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  0
                </td>
                <td>
                  Maximum score
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td
                  className="e-nowrap"
                >
                  use-language-of-instruction
                </td>
                <td>
                  Boolean
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  false
                </td>
                <td>
                  Whether the student should answer the question in the language of instruction (typically the mother tongue) or the subject language. This attribute controls the HTML lang attribute of the input element, so a screen reader will read the answer using the correct language. Used only in secondary language exams.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  class
                </td>
                <td>
                  CSS class
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  -
                </td>
                <td>
                  CSS class name
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  meta
                </td>
                <td>
                  String
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  –
                </td>
                <td>
                  Metadata about element
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          

      
          <table
            className="e-table e-width-full"
          >
            <caption>
              
          Element attributes (
          
              <code>
                e:accepted-answer
              </code>
              
          )
        
            </caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>
                  Attribute
                </th>
                <th>
                  Type
                </th>
                <th>
                  Mandatory
                </th>
                <th>
                  Default value
                </th>
                <th>
                  Description
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  score
                </td>
                <td>
                  Integer
                </td>
                <td>
                  Yes
                </td>
                <td>
                  -
                </td>
                <td>
                  Score for answer
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  meta
                </td>
                <td>
                  String
                </td>
                <td>
                  No
                </td>
                <td>
                  –
                </td>
                <td>
                  Metadata about element
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          

      
          <h4>
            
        Example of
        
            <code>
              e:scored-text-answer
            </code>
            
      
          </h4>
          
      
          <pre
            className="code"
          >
            &lt;e:hints&gt;
  Lorem ipsum,
  &lt;e:scored-text-answer&gt;
    &lt;e:hint&gt;dolor?&lt;/e:hint&gt;
    &lt;e:accepted-answer score="1"&gt;dolor&lt;/e:accepted-answer&gt;
  &lt;/e:scored-text-answer&gt;
  dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing
  &lt;e:scored-text-answer&gt;
    &lt;e:hint&gt;elit?&lt;/e:hint&gt;
    &lt;e:accepted-answer score="1"&gt;elit&lt;/e:accepted-answer&gt;
  &lt;/e:scored-text-answer&gt;
  . Aliquam, explicabo. Ut,
  &lt;e:scored-text-answer&gt;
    &lt;e:hint&gt;vero?&lt;/e:hint&gt;
    &lt;e:accepted-answer score="1"&gt;vero&lt;/e:accepted-answer&gt;
  &lt;/e:scored-text-answer&gt;
  ? Exercitationem eos unde possimus
  &lt;e:scored-text-answer&gt;
    &lt;e:hint&gt;laboriosam?&lt;/e:hint&gt;
    &lt;e:accepted-answer score="1"&gt;laboriosam&lt;/e:accepted-answer&gt;
  &lt;/e:scored-text-answer&gt;
  , consectetur cum perspiciatis aut
  &lt;e:scored-text-answer&gt;
    &lt;e:hint&gt;dolores?&lt;/e:hint&gt;
    &lt;e:accepted-answer score="1"&gt;dolores&lt;/e:accepted-answer&gt;
  &lt;/e:scored-text-answer&gt;
  quas autem eaque impedit dolore. Blanditiis, eos doloribus.
&lt;/e:hints&gt;
          </pre>
          
      
