          <h4>
            
        Example without hints
      
          </h4>
          
      
          <p>
            
        
            <code>
              e:scored-text-answer
            </code>
            
        can also be used without hints, e.g. in
        mathematics exams.
      
          </p>
          
      
          <pre
            className="code"
          >
            &lt;e:formula&gt;\\frac{4{\\pi}}{2}&lt;/e:formula&gt; simplified:
&lt;e:scored-text-answer max-score="3"/&gt;
          </pre>
          
      
