              <span
                className="e-screen-reader-only"
              >
                \\LaTeX
              </span>
              
          formulas by using
          
              <code>
                e:formula
              </code>
              
          element. Formulas can be placed both
          within text (
          
              <code>
                inline
              </code>
              
          ) and on their own line (
          
              <code>
                display
              </code>
              
          ).
        
            </p>
            
        
            <p>
              
          By default, the
          
