        <div
          aria-description="Tähän kysymykseen ei ole vastattu"
          className="e-exam-question e-level-0 e-mrg-b-8 e-clearfix no-answer"
          id="29"
        >
          
      
          <h3
            className="exam-question-title"
          >
            <strong
              className="exam-question-title__display-number"
            >
              29. 
            </strong>
            Text columns
             
          </h3>
          
      
          <div
            className="exam-question-instruction e-mrg-b-2"
            id="question-instruction-194"
          >
            
        
            <p>
              
          Text columns can be added using
          
              <code>
                e-columns
              </code>
              
          class. Ever child element within it must have
          
              <code>
                
          e-column
              </code>
              
          class
        
            </p>
            
        
            <p>
              There is some empty space between columns.
            </p>
            
      
          </div>
          

      
          <h4>
            Example
          </h4>
          

      
          <p>
            By default columns have equal width
          </p>
          
      
          <pre
            className="code"
          >
            &lt;div class="e-columns"&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column"&gt;e-column&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column"&gt;e-column&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column"&gt;e-column&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column"&gt;e-column&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          </pre>
          
      
          <div
            className="example grid-example"
          >
            
        
            <div
              className="e-columns"
            >
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column block"
              >
                e-column
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column block"
              >
                e-column
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column block"
              >
                e-column
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column block"
              >
                e-column
              </div>
              
        
            </div>
            
      
          </div>
          

      
          <p>
            You can also use a 12 column system
          </p>
          
      
          <pre
            className="code"
          >
            &lt;div class="e-columns"&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--6"&gt;e-column--6&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--3"&gt;e-column--3&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--3"&gt;e-column--3&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="e-columns"&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--8"&gt;e-column--8&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--2"&gt;e-column--2&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--2"&gt;e-column--2&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="e-columns"&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--2"&gt;e-column--2&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--8"&gt;e-column--8&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--2"&gt;e-column--2&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          </pre>
          
      
          <div
            className="example grid-example"
          >
            
        
            <div
              className="e-columns"
            >
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--6 block"
              >
                e-column--6
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--3 block"
              >
                e-column--3
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--3 block"
              >
                e-column--3
              </div>
              
        
            </div>
            

        
            <div
              className="e-columns"
            >
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--8 block"
              >
                e-column--8
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--2 block"
              >
                e-column--2
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--2 block"
              >
                e-column--2
              </div>
              
        
            </div>
            

        
            <div
              className="e-columns"
            >
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--2 block"
              >
                e-column--2
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--8 block"
              >
                e-column--8
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--2 block"
              >
                e-column--2
              </div>
              
        
            </div>
            
      
          </div>
          

      
          <p>
            
        To make column as narrow as possible, use
        
            <code>
              e-column--narrow
            </code>
            
        class.
      
          </p>
          
      
          <pre
            className="code"
          >
            &lt;div class="e-columns"&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column"&gt;e-column&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="e-column e-column--narrow"&gt;e-column--narrow&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          </pre>
          
      
          <div
            className="example grid-example"
          >
            
        
            <div
              className="e-columns"
            >
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column block"
              >
                e-column
              </div>
              
          
              <div
                className="e-column e-column--narrow block"
              >
                e-column--narrow
              </div>
              
        
            </div>
            
      
          </div>
          
    
        </div>
        
  
      </div>
    </section>
    

  
    
  
    

    <div
      className="e-logout-container"
    >
      <div
        className="e-bg-color-off-white e-pad-6 shadow-box"
      >
        <h3>
          Päätä koe
        </h3>
        <p>
          Kun olet tarkistanut vastauksesi, päätä koe klikkaamalla alla olevaa nappia.
          <br />
          Napin klikkaamisen jälkeen et voi enää palata kokeeseen.
        </p>
        <button
          className="e-button"
          id="endSession"
          onClick={[Function]}
        >
          Päätä koe
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>,
  <footer
    className="e-footer"
  />,
]
`;

