            <div
              className="exam-question-instruction e-mrg-b-2"
              id="question-instruction-254"
            >
              
        
        
              <span
                lang="sv-FI"
              >
                
          
                <p>
                  Då man löser ekvationer används ofta den distributiva lagen exempelvis då man avlägsnar parenteser genom multiplikation;
          
                </p>
                <p
                  className="e-text-center"
                >
                  <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    className="e-formula e-block e-text-center"
                    dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
                      {
                        "__html": "<svg xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="17.898ex" height="2.676ex" style="vertical-align: -0.782ex;" viewBox="0 -815.3 7705.9 1152.1" role="img" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-labelledby="MathJax-SVG-1-Title">
